      "doctor_question": "Hello. What brings you into the clinic today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S009",
      "patient_response": "Hi. Um, well, what finally made me make an appointment and ask for help is that I just keep forgetting little things I normally handle without an issue. Like returning phone calls, or turning in a registration form... which reminds me, the last form I had to fill out was for this community center thing, and they changed their whole online system last month. It is just a complete nightmare to navigate now. My sister tried to sign up for a ceramics class on there and it double-charged her credit card, so she had to spend like two hours on the phone with her bank just to get it sorted out. She makes really nice bowls, though. But, um, what was I saying? Oh, right, yeah, just forgetting stuff like that, or I'll tell myself to stop for an errand on the way home from work and then completely blank on it until I'm already pulling into my driveway.",
